# vars/ and sops/ are intentionally tracked.
# vars/ contains sops-encrypted secrets — safe to commit, decryptable only
# with the private keys in ~/.config/sops/age/keys.txt (not in this repo).
# sops/ contains public keys and encrypted secrets — also safe to commit.
# Tracking both enables full reproducibility across machines.
